# Draft classes

A career makes up a draft class when a season ends. Put a file named `<year>.yaml` here (for
example `2027.yaml` for the draft after the 2026 season) and careers use that class instead. The
format is the one the game writes to `careers/<career>/draft/<year>.yaml` (a good place to start
from): see README.md, "Career mode" > "Draft".

```yaml
year: 2027
prospects:
  - {name: 'Jordan Example', pos: QB, college: 'Ohio State', age: 22, height: 75, weight: 222,
     run_style: balanced, development: 70,
     stats: {games: 13, cmp_pct: 67, pass_yds: 3950, pass_td: 36, ints: 7},
     ratings: {pass_accuracy: 80, deep_accuracy: 76, pass_arm_strength: 84, pass_read_coverage: 72,
               vision: 74, speed: 70, awareness: 60},
     scouting: {pass_accuracy: [74, 86]}}
```

Missing ratings get the defaults, missing scouting ranges are made up.
# Coach file, see reynolds.yaml for all options.
name: Coach Brandt
style: Ground and pound, blitz-happy defense
discipline: 78

offense:
  pass_tendency: 0.42
  aggressiveness: 0.35
  deep_shot: 0.35
  play_action: 0.75           # sells play action off the run game
  variety: 0.75
  pass_by_situation:
    first_and_10: 0.38
    second_short: 0.25
    second_medium: 0.45
    second_long: 0.6
    third_short: 0.2
    third_medium: 0.7
    third_long: 0.88
    red_zone: 0.4
    goal_line: 0.25
    two_minute: 0.85
    protect_lead: 0.15
  fourth_down:
    go_for_it_max_to_go: 1
    go_for_it_from_yard_line: 55
    max_field_goal: 52
  two_point: chart
  favorite_plays:
    Power O: 1.5
    Inside Zone: 1.3
    PA Bootleg: 1.3

defense:
  blitz: 0.45
  man: 0.55
  prevent_when_leading_late: false
  by_situation:
    third_long: {blitz: 0.55}
    third_short: {blitz: 0.6, man: 0.7}
    red_zone: {man: 0.65}
    goal_line: {blitz: 0.65, man: 0.7}
    two_minute: {blitz: 0.3}
  favorite_plays:
    Cover 1 Man: 1.3
    Fire Zone: 1.3
# Coach file. Teams reference it with  coach: reynolds  (the file name).
# All tendencies are 0..1. Situations (used by pass_by_situation and by_situation):
#   first_and_10, first_short, second_short (1-3 to go), second_medium (4-6), second_long (7+),
#   third_short (1-2), third_medium (3-6), third_long (7+), fourth_short, fourth_long,
#   red_zone (inside the 20), goal_line (inside the 5 and two-point tries),
#   two_minute (trailing late in a half), protect_lead (leading late in the game)
# The most specific matching situation wins: two_minute / protect_lead > goal_line > red_zone > down & distance.
name: Coach Reynolds
style: Pass-happy and aggressive, loves the deep ball
discipline: 62                # 0-99, team-wide penalty rate (players' own discipline counts more)

offense:
  pass_tendency: 0.62         # fallback pass share where no situation below applies
  aggressiveness: 0.7         # 4th downs, deep shots, two-point tries
  deep_shot: 0.7              # how far downfield he likes to attack on passing downs
  play_action: 0.6
  variety: 0.5                # 0 = keeps calling his favourites, 1 = never repeats himself
  pass_by_situation:          # share of pass calls
    first_and_10: 0.58
    second_short: 0.45
    second_medium: 0.6
    second_long: 0.72
    third_short: 0.45
    third_medium: 0.8
    third_long: 0.93
    red_zone: 0.6
    goal_line: 0.45
    two_minute: 0.9
    protect_lead: 0.35
  fourth_down:
    go_for_it_max_to_go: 3     # goes for it with 3 or less to go ...
    go_for_it_from_yard_line: 45   # ... once he is at his own 45 or beyond
    max_field_goal: 56
  two_point: aggressive        # chart | aggressive | never | always
  favorite_plays:              # multiplies the chance of calling a play (by name)
    Four Verticals: 1.4
    Smash: 1.3
    PA Deep Post: 1.3

defense:
  blitz: 0.25
  man: 0.35
  prevent_when_leading_late: true
  by_situation:
    third_long: {blitz: 0.35, man: 0.3}
    third_short: {blitz: 0.45, man: 0.6}
    goal_line: {blitz: 0.5, man: 0.6}
    two_minute: {blitz: 0.1, man: 0.2}
  favorite_plays:
    Cover 2 (Tampa): 1.3
    Nickel Quarters: 1.2
